{
  "maps": {
    "42": {
      "name": "Pallet Town",
      "events": {
        "3": {
          "name": "Blue",
          "pages": {
            "0": {
              "conditions": {},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 3,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "\\PN! Hey! Over here!"
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            "1": {
              "conditions": {},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 8,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "\\PN! You got your letter too,",
                    "right? The one from Professor Oak?"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 11,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Today's the day! We're actually",
                    "going to be trainers!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 14,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "I've been pacing around the house",
                    "for like an hour. I couldn't sleep."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 16,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Can you believe it? Real, licensed",
                    "trainers. Us."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 19,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Remember when we used to pretend the",
                    "tall grass was a Route and your mom's",
                    "Meowth was a wild Pokémon?"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 22,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "...She was not happy about that."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 25,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Anyway — Professor Oak told me to",
                    "meet him at the lab. Let's go!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 28,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "This is going to be amazing.",
                    "I can feel it."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        "29": {
          "name": "Oak intro",
          "pages": {
            "0": {
              "conditions": {},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 4,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Hey! Wait! Don't go out there!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 26,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "The Routes aren't safe for unlicensed",
                    "travelers. Wild Pokémon live in the",
                    "tall grass — you need your own",
                    "Pokémon for protection."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 29,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Come with me to the lab. That's why",
                    "I sent for you and \\V[12], after all."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "77": {
      "name": "Oak's Lab",
      "events": {
        "6": {
          "name": "Blue",
          "pages": {
            "0": {
              "conditions": {},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 1,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "\\PN! You made it! I've been here",
                    "for ages. Professor Oak said to wait."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            "1": {
              "conditions": {},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 1,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "So many choices... I want all three.",
                    "But I guess that's not how it works."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        "7": {
          "name": "Oak (main)",
          "pages": {
            "1": {
              "conditions": {},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 35,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Professor! We've been waiting!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 37,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "\\PN, \\V[12] — thank you for coming.",
                    "I know I've kept you waiting."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 40,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "You're both old enough now to begin",
                    "the trainer licensing program."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 43,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "There are three Pokémon here. Each",
                    "one has been raised in this lab, and",
                    "each one is ready for a partner."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 46,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Professor! Can I pick too?"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 48,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Of course, \\V[12]. You'll each",
                    "choose one. \\PN — you first."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            "2": {
              "conditions": {},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 1,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "The Pokéballs are on the table."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 3,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Take your time. This is an important",
                    "choice — your first partner."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            "3": {
              "conditions": {},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 8,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "\\V[5]... a fine choice."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 11,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Then I'll take this one!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 20,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Oh, and Gramps — you said you had a",
                    "DNA Splicer? The thing from TV?"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 23,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "I'll take the other two and try",
                    "fusing them! This is so cool!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 65,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Fusion. It's what my research has",
                    "made possible. Two Pokémon can be",
                    "merged into something entirely new."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 69,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "It works on every Pokémon. The",
                    "League regulates who can perform",
                    "fusions — that's part of why the",
                    "licensing program matters."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 71,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "I wish I had more Splicers to give",
                    "you, \\PN. But that was my last pair.",
                    "The Routes aren't safe for unlicensed",
                    "travelers. That's why we have trainers.",
                    "That's why the League... matters."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 74,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Now go. Both of you. Your journey",
                    "starts today."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
